WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.889 --> 00:00:03.528
(bouncy, playful music)

00:00:03.528 --> 00:00:07.528
- [Narrator] Le Moulin
Jaune is a curious place.

00:00:09.419 --> 00:00:10.502
Very curious.

00:00:12.374 --> 00:00:15.874
And it all comes from the mind of a clown.

00:00:47.029 --> 00:00:49.448
- [Narrator] Slava is an
avant-garde performance artist

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:52.538
and one of the most recognizable
clowns in the world.

00:00:52.538 --> 00:00:54.728
He grew up in Communist
Russia and spent his youth

00:00:54.728 --> 00:00:57.626
idolizing Charlie Chaplin.

00:00:57.626 --> 00:01:00.066
Slava revolutionized the art of clowning,

00:01:00.066 --> 00:01:03.983
moving it out of the
circus and onto the stage.

00:01:29.053 --> 00:01:31.874
- [Narrator] The Moulin Jaune
is Slava's creative space,

00:01:31.874 --> 00:01:34.835
where he and his family
and his Academy of Fools

00:01:34.835 --> 00:01:38.476
host open events, run
workshops and rehearsals,

00:01:38.476 --> 00:01:40.976
all in his surreal wonderland.

00:02:20.446 --> 00:02:22.613
(chiming)

